# The ABC / Dinamo faces (ABC Monument Grotesk, ABC Monument Grotesk Mono,
# ABC Monument Grotesk Semi Mono, ABC Marist) are not redistributable in an
# open source repo. They are loaded at runtime from fonts.ens.dev — see
# apps/{portal,manager}/src/assets/fonts/README.md. The Geist TTFs used for OG
# images (apps/portal/src/assets/fonts/og, apps/manager/public/og/fonts) are OFL
# and are committed on purpose.
apps/*/src/assets/fonts/**/*.woff
apps/*/src/assets/fonts/**/*.woff2
apps/*/src/assets/fonts/**/*.otf
apps/*/public/fonts/
